msgid ""
"Downloads from this server will be removed, and automatic rules will be "
"turned off"
msgstr ""
"Las descargas de este servidor serán eliminadas y las reglas automáticas se "
"desactivarán"

msgid ""
"Logs have secrets and absolute folder paths redacted, but you may still want "
"to review the logs before sharing them"
msgstr ""
"Los registros tienen secretos y rutas de carpeta absolutos redactados, pero "
"es posible que desee revisar los registros antes de compartirlos"

#, fuzzy
msgid "No results ¯\\_(°╭╮°)_/¯"
msgstr "Ningún resultado 302257\\_(302260342225255342225256302260)_/302257"

msgid ""
"Only downloads from this rule will be deleted. Shared and manual downloads "
"stay"
msgstr ""
"Sólo se eliminarán las descargas de esta regla. Se mantendrán las descargas "
"compartidas y manuales"

msgid ""
"Route server media through this device instead of sharing provider URLs with "
"the renderer"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Rufin will calculate the missing EBU R128 metadata for the whole library. "
"This can use significant CPU, battery, and network bandwidth for a long time."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Saved mapping. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadata, "
"{unmatched} unmatched of {total} track"
msgid_plural ""
"Saved mapping. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadata, "
"{unmatched} unmatched of {total} tracks"
msgstr[0] ""
"Mapeo guardada. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadato, "
"{unmatched} sin coincidir {total} pista"
msgstr[1] ""
"Mapeo guardada. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadatos, "
"{unmatched} sin coincidir {total} pistas"

msgid ""
"Tap to the entry to load the lyrics and save in the app cache, click save "
"only if you also want to save it in your music folder"
msgstr ""
"Pulse a la entrada para cargar las letras y guardar en el caché de la "
"aplicación, haga clic en sólo guardar si también desea guardarlo en su "
"carpeta de música"

msgid ""
"Thank you for trying out Rufin! If you have problems or suggestions, please "
"open an issue in Github."
msgstr ""
"¡Gracias por probar Rufin! Si tiene problemas o sugerencias, por favor abra "
"un problema en Github."

msgid ""
"These folders are combined into the Local source and shown through folder "
"browsing"
msgstr ""
"Estas carpetas están combinadas en la fuente local y se muestran a través de "
"la navegación de carpetas"

msgid ""
"This is not supported natively by this source, but Rufin can show partial "
"stars and then round them up for the source"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This removes the server, cached library metadata, queue snapshot, and saved "
"token for"
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina el servidor, metadatos de biblioteca en caché, instantánea de "
"cola y token guardado para"

msgid ""
"This uses Jellyfin API for play radio, necessary if you want recommendation "
"plugins to work"
msgstr ""
"Esto utiliza la API de Jellyfin para reproducir radio, necesaria si desea "
"que los plugins de recomendación funcionen"

msgid ""
"This will log you out and clear your secrets including API ones. Your app "
"cache is not touched."
msgstr ""
"Esto cerrará su sesión y limpiará sus secretos incluyendo los de API. Su "
"caché de aplicación no se tocará."

msgid ""
"This will overwrite your lyrics file with what Rufin fetched, it may be a "
"better experience to use a dedicated program or plugin to fetch lyrics "
"instead."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Track evens out every song, while Album preserves the intended differences "
"within each album"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Unsaved changes. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadata, "
"{unmatched} unmatched of {total} track"
msgid_plural ""
"Unsaved changes. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadata, "
"{unmatched} unmatched of {total} tracks"
msgstr[0] ""
"cambio sin guardar. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadata, "
"{unmatched} sin coincidir {total} pista"
msgstr[1] ""
"cambios sin guardar. {direct} direct, {prefix} prefix, {metadata} metadata, "
"{unmatched} sin coincidir {total} pistas"

msgid ". You only need to fill email and an application name parts"
msgstr ""
". Sólo necesita llenar el correo electrónico y las partes de nombre de "
"aplicación"

